{
  "notes": [
    "Where an exhausted space draws its makeup air from, when makeup_source is 'Adjacent'.",
    "makeup_air keys on the all-level space type taxonomy, which is what create_typical builds from. makeup_space_types is an ordered preference list: the first name with an adjacent space wins, so a school kitchen prefers its own cafeteria and falls back to a general dining space.",
    "legacy_makeup_air is the DOE prototype (building_type, space_type) table this replaces, kept because prototype models set standardsSpaceType to prototype names.",
    "Only kitchens appear. Supermarket bakery and deli hoods do draw makeup from the sales floor in practice, but the prototype table never modeled that and adding it here would be a new assumption rather than a crosswalk of an existing one."
  ],
